WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:03.230
<b><i>Quratar Labyrinth</i></b>

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:06.230
<b><i>Seventh Floor</i></b>

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.340
<i>Fireball!</i>

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.190
Impressive as always, Master.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.450
<b><i>Rabbit Pelt</i></b>

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:24.110
We've gathered quite a few of those.

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:26.800
Yeah, thanks to you.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:34.380
<b><i>Imperial City</i></b>

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:33.100
Rabbit pelts?

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:33.870
Yes.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.710
I doubt the guild will pay us much for them,

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:41.630
but I've heard the clothing stores 
here will buy them for a high price.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:45.670
But why? It's a low level item.

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:50.410
Coats made from rabbit pelts make 
exceptional cold weather clothes.

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:53.150
They're very popular among noble women.

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:54.610
I see.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:57.100
So there's demand for them.

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:00.520
Thank you for waiting, Master.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:01.680
What'd they say?

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:05.040
They'll buy them from us if 
we have at least one hundred.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:08.810
There's one.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:12.000
<b><i></i></b><b>Slow Rabbit: Lv 7</b>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:14.510
<i>It pains my conscience.</i>

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:17.260
<i>This pains my conscience, but...</i>

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:19.910
<i>Fireball!</i>

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:31.060
<b>in the Labyrinth of Another World</b>

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:31.060
<b>Harem</b>

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:54.460
This way.

00:02:57.010 --> 00:03:00.400
Seems like we'll have plenty 
in no time, thanks to you.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:02.290
I'm glad to be useful.

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:10.920
It was worth coming so early 
in the morning, Master.

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:16.420
It's a treasure chest.

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:19.420
This is a treasure chest?

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:26.010
<i>The ground here isn't made of dirt.</i>

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:28.020
<b><i>Quratar Labyrinth, Seventh Floor
 Boss Waiting Room</i></b>

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.570
<b><i></i></b>Rapid Rabbit: Lv 7

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:42.140
<i>The only thing different about 
this one is that it's red.</i>

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:45.020
<i>It's still pretty cute.</i>

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:50.080
<i>I take it back.</i>

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:52.810
<i>It's fast.</i>

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:55.250
<i>Quit scurrying around.</i>

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:00.510
<i>Roxanne never ceases to amaze me.</i>

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:04.890
<i>It thinks it can hit me, huh?</i>

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:08.480
<i>But that's what you call overconfidence.</i>

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.310
<i>Overwhelming!</i>

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:15.730
<i>I've got my own way of doing things.</i>

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.530
Impressive, Master.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:24.480
It was so quick, even I 
nearly lost sight of it.

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:26.490
Thanks, Roxanne.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:32.750
<b><i>Rabbit Meat</i></b>

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:31.040
<i>Did it have to drop it on the ground?</i>

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.750
<i>I'll have to wash that 
thoroughly when we get home.</i>

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.400
Rabbit meat...

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:39.070
Perfect. We can have it for lunch.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:42.030
In that case, how do you 
feel about a schema roast?

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:43.880
Schema roast?

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:46.890
<b><i>Quratar, Michio's House</i></b>

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.350
First, sprinkle salt and 
pepper on the rabbit meat.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:54.350
Then wrap them in schema leaves 
from the yard and skewer them.

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:59.860
Finally, drizzle olive oil over 
the meat so it chars nicely,

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:02.220
and your schema roast is ready to eat.

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:16.420
This really is good.

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:21.210
Maybe we should gather some more rabbit 
meat while we're collecting pelts.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:25.800
I see you've developed 
a taste for rabbit meat.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.930
<b><i>Quratar Labyrinth, Seventh Floor</i></b>

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:34.480
Master, the Boss Room is up ahead.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:37.480
<b><i>Quratar Labyrinth, Seventh Floor
 Boss Waiting Room</i></b>

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:45.520
<i>He's alone, huh?</i>

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:47.340
<i>Looks like there's a little bit of a wait.</i>

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.120
Are you a two-person party?

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:53.840
Yeah. You're alone, huh? 
That must be tough.

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:57.710
I'm trying to save up money 
to gather party members,

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.380
but I can't help but spend money.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.410
<i>In other words, he wants to buy slaves.</i>

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:04.280
<i>He's like how I used to be.</i>

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:08.090
It's been more than two years since I 
started coming to the seventh floor.

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:10.400
My Explorer level has risen,

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:12.250
so I thought I'd take this 
opportunity to go higher.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:14.390
I see. Well, good luck.

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:15.930
Thank you.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:17.790
If I beat the next boss,

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:20.170
I'll finally be able to acquire 
my first party member.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:30.400
Looks like luck is finally turning my way.

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:31.170
If you'll excuse me.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.700
<i>Two years on the seventh floor?</i>

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:43.980
<i>Then he's a veteran of labyrinths.</i>

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:48.130
<i>There are limits to what 
you can accomplish alone.</i>

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:52.060
<i>I was once in the same boat, 
so I understand that very well.</i>

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:54.220
Master, it's our turn.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.270
Okay. Let's go.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.770
<i>The boss is already waiting for us?</i>

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:04.900
<i>We haven't seen this before.</i>

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.570
<i>There might be something 
special about this encounter.</i>

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.970
<i>I'll use Overwhelming off 
the bat and finish it off.</i>

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:13.280
Let me handle this, Roxanne.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:15.540
<i>Overwhelming!</i>

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:26.180
<i>Nothing unusual happened.</i>

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:28.230
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:31.480
What's that?

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:38.690
Huh. Sometimes there's 
equipment in Boss Rooms, huh?

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:42.060
I believe that equipment belonged 
to the party that entered before us.

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:44.890
Really?

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:49.200
Yes, since the boss was already 
in the room when we entered.

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:53.470
<i>It was already waiting in 
the room for the next party</i>

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:56.370
<i>since it had beaten the previous group.</i>

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:03.850
That's a black Magic Crystal.

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:07.830
If you press your own Magic Crystal 
against it, they should merge easily.

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:14.760
If I beat the next boss, I'll finally be 
able to acquire my first party member.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.990
Looks like luck is finally turning my way.

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:18.780
If you'll excuse me.

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:25.540
<i>That friendly guy was beaten by that boss.</i>

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:30.790
<i>Is this all our lives are worth?</i>

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:34.230
Is something wrong, Master?

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:35.610
No.

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:40.780
Let's go home.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:44.870
<b><i>Quratar, Michio's House</i></b>

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:50.550
<i>Error

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:52.570
Master...

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:08.910
Master...

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:13.390
You're so rough today.

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:18.080
Master...

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:27.170
<i>I knew the labyrinths were a dangerous place.</i>

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.250
<i>That people lost their lives there.</i>

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:33.570
<i>But it was just a fact I knew.</i>

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:38.840
<i>That Explorer in line ahead of us challenged the boss</i>

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:40.730
<i>and disappeared.</i>

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:45.470
<i>There's no guarantee that 
won't be me tomorrow.</i>

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:50.110
<i>It wouldn't be surprising if my own 
position suddenly changed in the future.</i>

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:53.240
<i>Labyrinths are like rickety bridges.</i>

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:57.030
<i>Depending on which plank you step on, 
the floor could fall out from beneath you.</i>

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:02.120
<i>Why am I crossing that kind of bridge?</i>

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:05.360
<i>No, I shouldn't think that way.</i>

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:13.490
<i>When the night is so quiet, 
I can't stop thinking about it.</i>

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:15.380
Master?

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:18.130
You can't sleep?

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:21.690
I'll fall asleep eventually.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:40.530
<i>Error

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:30.290
Come here.

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:31.650
Roxanne?

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:36.570
If there's anything I can 
do to help, I'll do it.

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:39.910
After all, you're my master.

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:53.040
<i>I don't know if she knew what I was thinking,</i>

00:10:53.040 --> 00:11:10.060
<i>Error

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:55.460
<i>but she's warm.</i>

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:00.360
Thank you, Roxanne.

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:01.550
Not at all.

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:05.570
I'm happy, too.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:15.190
<b><i>Quratar, Michio's House</i></b>

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:20.000
Good morning, Roxanne.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:22.700
Good morning, Master.

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:24.570
Have you calmed down?

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:30.080
<b><i>Quratar Labyrinth</i></b>

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:32.300
<i>The Explorer we met yesterday is dead.</i>

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:32.960
<b><i>Spy Spider</i></b>

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:32.960
<b><i>Escape Goat</i></b>

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:38.760
<i>It's still true that 
could be me tomorrow, but...</i>

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:43.340
<i>Right now, all I can do is get stronger</i>

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:48.130
<i>so I won't be weak anymore.</i>

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:53.080
<i>Even if I step on the wrong plank,</i>

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:57.060
<i>I just need to become 
strong enough to hang on.</i>

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:58.780
Master.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:02.100
<i>All right. I'm not having trouble fighting.</i>

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:15.330
<i>Item Box.</i>

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:18.840
<b><i></i></b>Item Box

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.220
<i>We've saved up 300 of them, huh?</i>

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:25.560
Roxanne, let's head to the Imperial City.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.230
Yes, Master.

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:33.970
Welcome.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.890
I'd like to sell 300 rabbit pelts.

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:42.320
Thank you. This way, please.

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:45.500
<i>We gathered this many?</i>

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:52.260
I'm sorry, but given how many there 
are, this will take some time.

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:53.550
Is that all right?

00:12:53.550 --> 00:12:54.850
I'm not surprised.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:58.380
In that case, we'll pass 
the time in the shop.

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.860
Thank you.

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:02.840
The display room is in the back.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.350
They've got camisoles. They're made of silk.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:18.720
<i>It's not transparent, 
but it's still pretty sheer.</i>

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:22.020
<i>If Roxanne wore this...</i>

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:27.200
That product is very popular 
among noble women as sleepwear.

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:30.060
What do you think, Roxanne? It's not bad.

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:32.060
Um, I...

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:33.210
How much?

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:35.040
Eight hundred nars.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.070
Then, I'll take two.

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:39.960
Are you sure?

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.670
Don't worry about it. 
This is to thank you for yesterday.

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:45.670
Thank you.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:49.470
Let's get one of these light pink ones.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.390
I agree. For the other...

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.830
Thank you for waiting.

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:58.280
You can choose the other one.

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.940
Yes, Master.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:04.940
I counted exactly 300 pelts.

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:09.870
Each one is worth 10 nars, 
but since you brought so many,

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:12.250
I'd like to give you a bonus.

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:14.150
Sure, thanks.

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:18.460
<i>I have a feeling that was just my 30% 
bonus coming into effect, but whatever.</i>

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:22.210
<b><i>Quratar, Michio's House</i></b>

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:22.210
Thank you for buying sleepwear for me.

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:29.090
Um, I'll wear one of these when 
you take care of me tonight.

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:30.710
Could you choose one?

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:33.470
Of course, but first...

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:36.220
Let's take a bath.

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:45.090
<i>This part still sucks.</i>

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:46.270
Roxanne.

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:47.110
Yes, Master.

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:50.040
I'm heading to the Quratar labyrinth.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:51.620
Could you give me a hand?

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:54.570
I ran out of MP to make hot water with.

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:57.620
Understood. I'll get ready right away.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:01.120
<b><i>Quratar Labyrinth</i></b>

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:03.130
<b><i>Seventh Floor</i></b>

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:03.960
Monsters ahead.

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:13.720
<i>Same old, same old. 
Let's get this over with.</i>

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.720
<b><i>Cheep Sheep: Lv 7</i></b>

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.720
<b><i>Paunch: Lv 7</i></b>

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.720
<b><i>Collagen Coral: Lv 7</i></b>

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:19.020
<i>And once this is over, 
I've got a camisole waiting for—</i>

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.020
Master!

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.170
Master!

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:37.790
Are you all right?

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:39.640
Let me heal you.

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:42.190
I'm fine. It's just a scratch.

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:45.180
<i>I wish I could go back in time a few seconds</i>

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:48.000
<i>and tell myself overconfidence 
is my greatest enemy.</i>

00:15:56.520 --> 00:15:59.160
<i>My finger still feels swollen.</i>

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:01.920
<i>I'm pretty sure I recovered using Durandal.</i>

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.430
Are you all right, Master?

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:19.820
It might heal quicker if you sucked on it.

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:20.760
What?

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:28.460
Um, I've heard a little spit is enough 
to heal scratches, but I've never...

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:29.840
It's worth a shot.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:34.780
This is my first time doing this, 
so let me know if it hurts.

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:53.250
<i>It's so wet and warm.</i>

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:00.970
I'm sorry.

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:04.450
Don't worry about it. 
It feels good more than not.

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:05.830
Keep going.

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:27.570
How was that?

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:31.270
The pain's completely gone. Thank you.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:33.000
That wasn't difficult for you, was it?

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:36.700
It was surprisingly long, so I wasn't 
sure I'd be able to fit it in my mouth,

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:40.480
but it was fine since you stayed still.

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:42.660
<i>This makes me want to go further.</i>

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.060
<i>I really want to go further.</i>

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:47.370
I was actually hit somewhere else, too.

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:51.880
Could you suck my [bleep]?

00:17:53.850 --> 00:17:54.550
Yes, Master.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:58.380
<i>Error

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:57.390
It does look a little swollen.

00:17:57.390 --> 00:17:58.380
Allow me.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:04.850
<i>Error

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:18.480
Did that hurt?

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:21.490
No, quite the contrary.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:29.370
<i>She's taking pains to [bleep] 
so it doesn't [bleep].</i>

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:42.850
<i>Error

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:33.120
<i>All her attentiveness is paying off.</i>

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:38.580
<i>Maybe it's because she's gotten the hang 
of it, but she's way better than [bleep].</i>

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:45.850
<i>I had a painful experience 
today, but this evens it out.</i>

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.890
<i>No, this is better than even.</i>

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:51.620
<i>This is what you call a fortunate error.</i>

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:04.160
<i>Error

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.850
<i>What an incredible way to be healed.</i>

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:14.530
That was amazing.

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:17.410
Thanks to you, the pain is completely gone.

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:20.850
I-I see. Was that useful?

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:22.430
More than useful.

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:24.550
I thought you'd cast a spell on me.

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:28.770
I'm not sure my mouth can do that.

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:30.310
Oh, it certainly can.

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:33.870
Roxanne, you worked hard for me.

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:35.900
It's the same as healing magic.

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:37.840
Master...

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:48.070
What do you think?

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.420
That looks great on you.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:57.670
<i>Error

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:55.940
Thank you.

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:59.960
<i>The light pink adds a touch 
of color to her skin</i>

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:04.300
<i>as it elegantly and gently 
envelops Roxanne's body.</i>

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:24.410
<i>Error

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:08.840
<i>These two mountains are the exception.</i>

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:10.680
<i>They jut upwards sharply,</i>

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:14.070
<i>and tiny little delicacies 
can be found on their peaks.</i>

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:19.360
<i>Her clothes are trim, 
but what's beneath is out of control.</i>

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:22.070
Roxanne, could you spin around for me?

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:23.950
Yes, Master.

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:27.660
<i>Error

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:32.540
Roxanne, you're not wearing 
anything underneath?

00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:37.270
Well, it'd be visible 
beneath these clothes,

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:40.670
and I thought you'd prefer this.

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:44.350
Oh, I love it.

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:47.620
You look incredible.

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:49.600
Thank you.

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:52.740
<i>I'm glad I bought these.</i>

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:56.910
<i>Between the smoothness of the 
silk and Roxanne's skin,</i>

00:20:56.910 --> 00:20:59.200
<i>I can't wait any longer.</i>

00:21:01.890 --> 00:21:06.360
<i>Although in that regard, 
this wasn't such a good purchase.</i>

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:08.870
<b><i>Quratar Labyrinth</i></b>

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.620
<i>Firestorm!</i>

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:22.670
<i>In that case, one more.</i>

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:25.680
Master.

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:27.000
<i>I can't cast it in time.</i>

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:28.280
<i>Fireball!</i>

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:29.920
<i>This jerk.</i>

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:31.010
<i>Fireball!</i>

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:37.770
<i>It took all that to kill three?</i>

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:39.860
<i>It'll be tough for our 
current party to handle</i>

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:43.230
<i>the groups of up to four we've started 
encountering on the eighth floor.</i>

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:46.030
<i>I need to seriously consider 
expanding our party.</i>

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:51.760
<i>Huh? We only got two even 
though we defeated three?</i>

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:54.790
Great news, Master.

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:57.540
Look at this.

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:06.500
This is a Skill Crystal.

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:10.060
<b>in the Labyrinth of Another World</b>

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:10.060
<b>Harem</b>
